<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-M. Stanley ups Applied, KLA.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-M. Stanley ups Applied, KLA.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it raised both Applied Materials Inc and KLA Instruments Corp to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Jay Deanna was not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1736</p>
</text>
